    (hb : ∀ i, r i ≤ C0 * ρ ^ a ∧ (r i)⁻¹ ≤ C0 * ρ ^ a) :
    (ρ ^ (a * N + a * L))⁻¹ * (1 + ∑ i, r i + ∑ i, (r i)⁻¹) ^ N ≤
